  "createdAt": "2026-10-13T02:12:19.240946Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-13T05:39:49.517924Z",
  "totalBlocks": 64,
  "translatedBlocks": 58,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "667b39d386aad6d2",
      "translationZh": "强化学习环境为智能体式 AI 系统赋予了新的能力，也是衡量和提升智能体性能的绝佳方式。因此，Hugging Face Hub 现在为强化学习环境开辟了专门的空间。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "eb5f8e4e76817bbc",
      "translationZh": "环境为智能体提供任务，以观测回应其动作，并对结果进行评分。由此产生的奖励可以在评估期间衡量智能体的性能，也可以在训练期间提供学习信号。有关这一交互循环的介绍，请参阅我们关于环境的博客文章。在环境中，智能体会执行一组以数据集形式表示的任务。因此，环境大体上可以分为两部分：任务集和运行时。在此次发布中，我们重点关注任务集。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d4e8ceb584f8ebf7",
      "translationZh": "Hub 上的强化学习环境是一个数据集仓库，会显示在新增的 RL Environments 筛选项中。Use this dataset 按钮会提供在相应框架中运行它的命令。没有新的仓库类型，没有注册表，也不需要注册。目前已有适用于 Harbor、Verifiers 和 NVIDIA NeMo Gym 的环境。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "0cf573e926efd3db",
      "translationZh": "别再构建环境注册表了",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5168347cd062f4b5",
      "translationZh": "每篇强化学习论文或每个框架都用自己的方式查找环境：自定义平台、运行时注册表、独立的任务数据集，或是搭配自定义加载器的 GitHub 任务列表。这意味着许多已发布的环境彼此孤立：如果你为一个框架发布了环境，另外三个框架的用户就无法加载它。如果你想使用另一个框架或一篇新论文中的环境进行训练，就需要手动移植它。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cda1c9ac8af859d8",
      "translationZh": "我们认为这种组织方式不对。环境由任务、测试、容器和奖励规则组成，这些都是数据，上面再加一层运行时。Hub 已经能够存储数据、管理数据版本、控制数据访问权限、预览数据，并向数百万人提供数据。它不需要第二套系统来存放环境。它需要的是一种方式，能够说明：“这些数据就是一个环境，而这就是运行它的方法。”",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3d4969e4f7a1dadd",
      "translationZh": "任务数据存放在 Hub 上。运行时配置和验证器代码可以存放在仓库或框架中。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7cc38b4eeec8107a",
      "translationZh": "各个框架继续做自己擅长的事。Hub 做它擅长的事，也就是托管、发现和版本管理。没有谁必须拥有整个目录。事实上，目录也可以在其他平台上运行，由 Hub 提供支持。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2935898da789b733",
      "translationZh": "数据集仓库托管你的环境文件。框架在本地或受支持的云后端上运行这些文件。Hugging Face Jobs 可以运行云端工作负载，而基于 Jobs 构建的 Hugging Face Sandboxes 则提供交互式命令执行功能。这些标签描述兼容性并生成加载命令；添加标签不会启动作业或沙箱。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "68b8fd794db43127",
      "translationZh": "已上线的功能",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "10f9f2bd52026d3f",
      "translationZh": "RL Environments 筛选器。前往 huggingface.co/datasets?other=rl-environment。所有带有 rl-environment 标签的数据集都会显示在那里，无论它适用于哪个框架。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "665ed2bb601907b4",
      "translationZh": "框架标签。四个环境框架已注册为数据集库：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1503916a2ab2b0fd",
      "translationZh": "标签",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "192eb4525aabd7e2",
      "translationZh": "框架",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c1d64b2d4cb30f1b",
      "translationZh": "港口",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8a8c65415401f7ed",
      "translationZh": "港湾",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "94b58d29c26b7a1c",
      "translationZh": "验证器",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "496077d44e0643ee",
      "translationZh": "验证器",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fab39e0c4ea1b502",
      "translationZh": "每个框架标签都会在数据集页面上显示该框架的图标，并在“使用此数据集”中添加一个自动生成的代码片段。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0fa6796d22c6e138",
      "translationZh": "一个数据集可以带有多个框架标签。这正是其用意所在。标签描述的是兼容性，而兼容性并不是排他的。列出的每个框架都必须支持仓库中的文件；添加标签并不会转换这些文件。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c8b3307adbeb0949",
      "translationZh": "运行环境并检查其奖励",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3d6c30280cd50e1c",
      "translationZh": "选择适合你所用框架的示例，并在单独的 Python 环境中运行，所需前提条件如下所列。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "1a24438982a9e674",
      "translationZh": "Harbor：运行参考解法",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4cee476cd6fbfc1b",
      "translationZh": "Harbor 可以从 Hub 仓库加载任务目录。oracle 智能体运行任务的参考解法，然后由验证器对结果评分。它不会调用模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "06822ebbd176780a",
      "translationZh": "查看器会显示任务的奖励、验证器输出和日志。这样可以在你尝试模型智能体之前，检查任务及其参考解法。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9676360be056d6bf",
      "translationZh": "Verifiers：在同一任务上运行模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c046c01dc233e049",
      "translationZh": "verifiers v1 的 Harbor 集成可以在不同的运行时（例如 Docker）中运行相同的任务目录。它还支持不同的执行框架，包括一个最简 bash 执行框架。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cc354c7d32c6fbf8",
      "translationZh": "这里，repo 是完整的 Hugging Face Git URL，而 dataset 是该仓库的 registry.json 中的名称和版本。此加载器使用 Harbor 的注册表约定，因此仅凭一个 Hub 仓库 ID 无法替代这两个值。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "1b362494f9587fea",
      "translationZh": "OpenEnv：运行智能体并检查其奖励",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "03124c60b721fb41",
      "translationZh": "OpenEnv 的 Harbor 集成可以使用 OpenCode 等智能体运行同一组任务目录，并返回验证器的奖励以及智能体的运行轨迹。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "91ab41139afa1f89",
      "translationZh": "该命令会下载数据集的 tasks/ 目录，在 Docker 中运行一个任务，并写入结果。默认连接使用临时 Gradio 隧道，以便沙箱中的智能体能够访问 OpenEnv 的模型代理。读取验证器结果和模型调用次数：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "67f04bb7530e30f7",
      "translationZh": "奖励为 None 表示未产生验证器奖励；在将此次运行解释为模型失败之前，请先检查 error。此流程要求使用 Harbor 任务目录。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9a37dc99eabb9c23",
      "translationZh": "NeMo Gym：生成响应并检查奖励",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "20ba7dfeb94e28e2",
      "translationZh": "NeMo Gym 支持评估和强化学习训练：其环境收集轨迹并计算奖励，而训练框架负责更新模型权重。例如，Structured Outputs 数据集将提示与 JSON 模式配对。其验证器根据对模式的遵循程度给予奖励；它不会检查生成的内容在事实层面是否正确。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "12ffdd30bdc8056a",
      "translationZh": "最棒的是，这提供了一个统一的代码仓库和一个统一的讨论选项卡，人们可以在其中报告所有主要框架中存在问题的任务。因此，当作者修复一个有问题的测试时，每个框架都会在下一次拉取时获得该修复。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9b4dc450639943d1",
      "translationZh": "为你的环境添加标签",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7a665e98f50d2a91",
      "translationZh": "打开你的数据集卡片，将以下内容添加到 YAML 头部：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2718e71d50c7aa41",
      "translationZh": "这就是集成的全部步骤。保留 rl-environment，然后列出所有能够加载你的文件的框架。如果你的环境适用于我们尚未登记的框架，请提交一个 PR，将其添加到受支持的库列表中。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5bab20dfe51894ed",
      "translationZh": "文档中有完整的参考说明。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "408af1b1870470f4",
      "translationZh": "已在 Hub 上的环境",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f8f946abd6e77deb",
      "translationZh": "我们已提交 PR，为一些大家已经用于训练的环境添加标签。如果你维护其中某个环境，合并该 PR 后，你的环境就会出现在筛选器中。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "57e092964af00584",
      "translationZh": "BeyondSWE：以 Harbor 任务目录形式提供的 BeyondSWE 基准，每个实例对应一个文件夹。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "267965cda0f20787",
      "translationZh": "Terminal-Lego：基于真实 StackOverflow 问题构建的 Terminal-Bench 风格任务，仅保留通过 Docker 往返验证的任务。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "450bc4f98f043be4",
      "translationZh": "Harbor-Mix：从 Harbor 适配器池中挑选出的 100 个高难度智能体任务，运行成本低于完整的多基准测试评测。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "11870fa20b8d9503",
      "translationZh": "NatureBench：为 Harbor 预先构建的 90 个 NatureBench 任务。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "496077d44e0643ee",
      "translationZh": "验证器",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a9aacb5bb8b86d55",
      "translationZh": "Reverse-Text-RL：prime-rl 在 CI 中用于调试 RL 训练的小型反转任务。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3abcfedf733fb05a",
      "translationZh": "Multi-SWE-RL-Verified：4,703 条 Multi-SWE-RL 数据中通过标准答案补丁验证的 2,232 条，涵盖 C、Go、Java、JavaScript、Rust 和 TypeScript。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "47fc51792a5735c9",
      "translationZh": "R2E-Gym-Subset-Verified：经过验证的 R2E-Gym 子集。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "45e1796595c7b465",
      "translationZh": "Scale-SWE-Verified：20,181 个 Python 问题解决任务中，能够端到端提供干净奖励信号的 17,202 个任务。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5b0afacbdbdb85bd",
      "translationZh": "Workplace Assistant：一个多步骤工具使用沙盒，包含五个数据库、26 个工具和 690 项业务任务。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cb51b3985fcd47fe",
      "translationZh": "Structured Outputs：以结构化输出形式遵循指令。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f3cc930020a69ef7",
      "translationZh": "CFBench：多语言约束遵循。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "af56c330824fe797",
      "translationZh": "SysBench：多轮系统消息遵循。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "1afde71b02ce9be1",
      "translationZh": "接下来的计划",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b965463f39b9b358",
      "translationZh": "第一个版本为每个框架生成一个默认片段。下一步是为每个配置生成片段，这样，包含多组任务的仓库就能为每组任务显示正确的命令。之后，我们会研究如何对布局有严格要求的框架进行结构检测。构建自定义任务界面也会非常酷，我们已经在这里做了一些实验：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4ee8a61ed0e8e3d2",
      "translationZh": "更大的目标是让框架标签在所有地方都能自动添加。OpenEnv 已经在上传时这样做了。如果你维护 Harbor、Verifiers、Nemo Gym 或任何其他环境框架，请在推送流程中添加标签。只需几行代码，你的用户发布的每个环境就都能被其他人发现。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8d4673c73d2bb60f",
      "translationZh": "如果你训练智能体，就去浏览筛选器。如果你构建环境，就发布它们并添加标签，无论它们涵盖的是编程、工具使用、游戏、机器人技术，还是其他任务。请附上文件、可正常运行的执行命令，以及产生奖励的规则，以便其他人使用这些环境。如果你的框架尚未收录，请将其贡献到受支持的库列表中。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
